  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Gympedia",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tGympedia\n\t\n\nGympedia is a collection of agentic LLM trajectories and distilled skills gathered across the diverse task environments of GEM: A Gym for Agentic LLMs. It pairs raw agent rollouts (per task, per model) with human-/model-readable \"skill\" write-ups distilled from successful runs, so it can be used for behavior analysis, skill/knowledge distillation, SFT data curation, and agentic RL research.\n\nNote: This release intentionally excludes trajectories collected in synthetic\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Septzzz/Gympedia.",
